Query:
-- Description: Inspect which crop‐commodity records are available for 2022 in the FIELD CROPS
-- and HORTICULTURE groups so we know the exact spelling of the items we are after.
SELECT DISTINCT
  year,
  group_desc,
  commodity_desc,
  class_desc,
  statisticcat_desc,
  unit_desc
FROM `bigquery-public-data.usda_nass_agriculture.crops`
WHERE year = 2022
  AND group_desc IN ('FIELD CROPS','HORTICULTURE')
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
year,group_desc,commodity_desc,class_desc,statisticcat_desc,unit_desc
